sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Visitor
  participant B as Browser<br/>(Leaflet)
  participant RH as Route Handler<br/>/api/geo/regions
  participant DB as Postgres + PostGIS
  participant CDN as Vercel edge cache

  V->>B: Load /
  B->>CDN: GET /api/geo/regions
  alt cache HIT
    CDN-->>B: FeatureCollection (cached)
  else cache MISS
    CDN->>RH: GET /api/geo/regions
    RH->>DB: supabase.rpc('regions_geojson')
    DB->>DB: SELECT jsonb_build_object(...)<br/>FROM regions<br/>(uses GIST on geom)
    DB-->>RH: FeatureCollection
    RH-->>CDN: 200 + Cache-Control:<br/>s-maxage=3600, SWR=86400
    CDN-->>B: FeatureCollection
  end
  B->>B: L.geoJSON(fc).addTo(map)

  Note over B,CDN: On admin edit:<br/>Server Action calls revalidateTag('geo:regions')<br/>→ next request rebuilds cache.

  rect rgba(250,248,242,0.8)
    Note right of B: For villages (potentially 1000s):<br/>option A — same GeoJSON pipeline +<br/>Leaflet.markercluster<br/>option B — MVT tiles via ST_AsMVT +<br/>Leaflet.VectorGrid<br/>(decided in Phase 4 after profiling)
  end
